  "title": "Ghost Buses",
  "threat": "An adversary exploited the integrator’s VPN to compromise the CAD/AVL system, injecting false vehicle positions and run assignments. The OCC’s dispatch interface displayed buses on incorrect routes and at non-existent stops, while the RRTA Rider app and PIDS showed ghost buses—vehicles that were not physically present. This led to field confusion, false rider expectations, and operational paralysis.",
